    },
    {
      "type": "ascii",
      "start": 749,
      "end": 1152,
      "text": "ering production, the NeoTech NWM-1N is the first mech produced by NeoTech, Inc, a Clan Wolf in Exile company.\r\n\r\nThe NeoWolf is designed as a multi-role mech.  With the Active Probe and the TAG unit, it can seek out shutdown mechs and equipment and call down a rain of fire upon them.   The ER-PPC gives it Sniper ability, while the claw and the Medium Pulse Laser allow it to get close and brawl.   \r\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "len_string",
      "start": 1152,
      "end": 1616,
      "length": 462,
      "text": "The NeoWolf is a jack-of-all-trades, good at a lot of things, but excelling in nothing.    It's not fast enough to be a scout mech, and not as well armed as most medium Mechs.  Meant to be able to adapt at a moments notice, the NeoWolf is also well armored, giving it survivablility.  The MASC give it the ability to sprint up to it's opponant, unleash a barrage from it's PPC and pulse laser, then take a good swipe with it's claws, then get out of there again."
    },
    {
      "type": "len_string",
      "start": 1616,
      "end": 1762,
      "length": 144,
      "text": "No battle history so far for this mech.  Trials are doing well with the Wolves in Exile and the FC.  Primarily used as a sniper with both groups"
    },
